    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Best Practices",
      "Anchor": "best-practices",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Best Practices"
      ],
      "Text": "\u2705 Store tokens securely \u2013 Encrypt at rest, never expose in client-side code\n\u2705 Use refresh tokens \u2013 Don\u0027t make users re-authenticate every 60 days\n\u2705 Request minimum scopes \u2013 Only request what you need\n\u2705 Handle token expiry gracefully \u2013 Implement automatic refresh logic\n\u2705 Validate redirect URIs \u2013 Redirect URIs must match exactly with Developer Portal settings. The OAuth 2.0 state parameter is the only supported dynamic query parameter.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
